71 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 50 0 R
/E (Today, being comfortable with technology is an important part of student life. This project helped me understand what digital literacy really means and how we use it in our daily activities. Through different tasks, I explored useful tools and platforms that can support learning and communication. I created an infographic to spread awareness about safe internet use, set up my profiles on platforms like GitHub and LinkedIn, practised coding on HackerRank, and also made a small quiz using Google Forms. Working on these tasks made me realize how important it is to use digital tools wisely and responsibly. Overall, this project helped me improve my skills and gave me a better idea of how to build a strong and professional online presence for the future.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
