/P 52 0 R
/E (For this task, I created my digital portfolio by making profiles on GitHub, LinkedIn, and Kaggle. These platforms are helpful for students to build their online presence and start learning new skills. On GitHub, I created my account and added a profile README with my basic details like my name, branch, and what I want to learn. It will help me upload and manage my projects in the future. On LinkedIn, I added my education details such as my college, degree, and expected graduation year. It is useful for connecting with others and learning about opportunities.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
